WEBVTT

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:10.083
So, I'm going to do is all the four basic punches together.

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:11.333
Jab, cross, hook, uppercut.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.750
So, your going to get your guard up.

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:14.625
Were prepped , were ready to go.

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:18.083
Start with a jab then we go into a cross.

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.208
Then we go into a hook.

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:21.833
And, then to an upper cut.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Try it with a little tempo.

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:28.666
Good jab and cross and hook and upper.

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:33.458
Again, jab and cross, hook and up.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.875
Now, when this goes pretty fast.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:37.208
Again, if your doing this to music which is definitely a lot more fun.

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:41.500
If your doing this to music you want your feet to stomp with the music.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.583
Jab, cross, hook, up.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:46.000
Jab, cross, hook, up.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:50.500
Remember, to keep those feet lifting up off the ground.

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:52.791
Jab, cross, hook, up.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.625
You don't want them to ever stay planted.

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.291
Remember, the knees.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.500
You don't want those to tweak.

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:58.291
So picking them up.

00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:00.166
Jab, cross, hook, up.

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:02.500
Jab, cross, hook, up.

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:06.583
You want to make sure were picking the feet up.

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:13.083
Cause again, feet planted not so good.
